// Signing for the StezuHealth and RestActivity targets (project.yml configFiles, Debug and
// Release). This file is committed and names no team: CI builds unsigned
// (CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO) and needs none.
//
// Your own team goes in Config/Local.xcconfig, which is gitignored and written once per clone by
// scripts/set-team.sh. The include below is optional (#include?), so CI and a fresh clone build
// without it. xcodegen generate rewrites the project but never these files, so the team
// survives a regenerate.

CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
